			"Message": "chore(Land): Update OXC toolchain to 0.128.0 and sync Element with defensive hardening\n\nBump OXC dependencies from 0.127.0 to 0.128.0 across allocator, parser, transformer, minifier, codegen, semantic, span, and ast. Also update supporting crates: open (5.3.4), rustls (0.23.40), rustls-pki-types (1.14.1), zip (8.6.0).\n\nSynchronize Element submodule to d1fcac15, bringing Mountain's centralized LogSkyEmit for histogram visibility across 7 provider files, defensive URI/path guards in DiagnosticProvider/PathSecurity/FileSystem, and terminal resilience improvements. Sky receives defensive try/catch wrappers around all Tauri listener handlers to isolate failures rather than crash the listener loop.",
			"SHA": "40fe64f579addc5a8c4b70b5f914b033e3eaeaf1"
		},
